            "action_name": {
              "value": "Obliteration Beam"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, evocation, force)\n\nRequirements: The spiritbound aluum has bound a soul using its bind soul innate spell\n\nThe spiritbound aluum transforms the captured soul's essence into raw magical energy, channeling the spirit into a beam that deals 20d6 force damage in a 30-foot line (38 basic Reflex save). The remaining fragments of the captured soul are released to the Great Beyond. The spiritbound aluum can't use Obliteration Beam again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
